            "review_text": "GrandTour34150898272\n2 contributions\n0\nGU Peace People where to experience culture drinking beer style street thick Saigon Vietnam\nApr 2026 • Friends\nGU Pain People is a Pain People's Beverage in 99 West Thanh, Xinfu District, TP. The cafeteria has a cool open space, a simple chair table is the right type of bar with a beverage, suitable for meeting friends after work. The menu of the restaurant a variety of familiar beverages such as chicken leaf, salt chicken, pepper, roasted ribs, shrimp, seafood and many hybrid dishes are very suitable to drink beer. The restaurant serves cold beer, standard prices, tasty dishes, suitable for friends, office people and guests in the West Thanh area to eat, meet and relax in the evening. If you are looking for a happy, cheap, spacious West Thung Beverage, GU Peace People is the right place. Address: 99 West Thung, Xinfu, TP.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 17, 2026",
