            "review_text": "Companion17527933568\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nGreat local spot for drinks and food at a good price in Tay Thanh\nMar 2026 • Friends\nGU Bình Dân is a great local spot for drinks in the Tay Thanh area if you’re looking for somewhere tasty and budget-friendly. The place has a typical casual, local vibe—simple but clean and airy. It gets quite lively in the evening, which creates a really fun and authentic atmosphere.\n\nThe food is served quickly and is well-seasoned with bold flavors. The fried and stir-fried dishes pair especially well with beer. The fried tofu with scallion oil and peanuts is unique, rich, and definitely worth trying. Seafood and other dishes are also consistent in quality.\n\nThe staff are quick and attentive, and you don’t have to wait long after ordering. Prices are very reasonable, especially when sharing with a group of friends.\n\nOne big plus is that even when it’s busy, it’s not uncomfortably noisy—still a great place to hang out after work. If you come during peak hours, it’s better to arrive early to get a good seat.\n\nOverall ratings:\n\nFood: 4.5/5\nService: 4.5/5\nAtmosphere: 4/5\nValue: 5/5\nWait time: 4.5/5\n\nWill definitely come back again.\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2026",
